{title:'Keep this life',desc:'No rush. Your story is yours.'}
],'A NEW CHAPTER','Your current game is saved automatically in this browser.');
$('#helpBtn').onclick=()=>modal('A life that is yours','Walk around the little neighborhood, meet people, and decide what to do with your day. There is no single way to win.',[
{title:'Make a living',desc:'Visit the café or Civic Works and browse a job. Then use Find work to take a shift.'},
